## Recommended Skills

### trend-analysis
Monitor and analyze trending topics (热门话题), hashtags, and content patterns on 小红书. Identify rising trends before they peak and assess brand fit.

### content-calendar
Generate 30-day rolling content calendars with posting times optimized for {{target_demographic}}, content mix ratios, and trend integration windows.

### kol-evaluation
Evaluate potential KOL/KOC collaboration partners by engagement quality, audience overlap, content style fit, and cost-effectiveness for {{brand_category}}.

## Tool Configuration Notes

- **Content Library**: Maintain a structured content asset library with consistent naming for images, videos, and copy drafts.
- **Hashtag Database**: Track hashtag performance over time — impressions, engagement rate, competitive density — for the {{brand_category}} vertical.
- **Posting Schedule**: Optimize posting times for {{target_demographic}} peak activity (typically 7-9 PM and lunch hours in target city time zones).
- **Engagement Tracking**: Monitor 互动率 (engagement rate), 收藏率 (save rate), 分享率 (share rate), and 评论质量 (comment quality) as primary KPIs.

